{"decision":"edit","issues":[{"quote":"A continuous forward-tracking view steadily moves along an elevated pedestrian bridge path","problem":"The visible motion is not a clear straight forward-tracking path; the bridge deck drifts toward the right while the skyline stays roughly centered, and 'pedestrian' is not evidenced."},{"quote":"scattered clouds drift across a blue sky above the city","problem":"The clouds do not show clear independent drifting; apparent sky changes are tied to camera movement."},{"quote":"the deck and railings grow larger and slide toward the frame edges","problem":"The deck and railings do not simply grow larger and spread to both edges; they shift mainly toward the right side of the view."},{"quote":"the road and grassy verge below the right railing become more prominent","problem":"The newly prominent street and lamp post are on the left side of the bridge, not below the right railing."},{"quote":"so the scene reads as steady forward movement along the bridge, not a turn","problem":"The bridge path's rightward drift relative to the centered skyline indicates apparent lateral or rotational camera movement, not purely straight forward movement."}],"caption":"A moving view passes over an elevated bridge path. Its reddish-brown deck, split by a dark central seam and bordered by grey metal railings, narrows toward the city skyline. Dense green trees line the left side, while modern office blocks rise ahead: reflective glass cubes, dark-brick towers, and bright facades catching the sun. A strong lens flare glows in the upper right beneath scattered clouds in a blue sky.

As the view shifts, the bridge deck and railings slide toward the right. The left foliage remains thick, and the street and slender lamp post beside the left railing become more visible. The central glass cube and surrounding towers stay roughly fixed in the distance, with the sun flare holding its place in the upper right.

No people or vehicles occupy the path itself. The bright sun continues to wash the glass facades with warm, hazy light, and the bridge path drifts steadily across the scene, keeping the city skyline centered.","length_note":""}
